  Text: |-
    Reachy Receiver drives a Reachy Mini robot from your Specs through a WebSocket bridge running on your computer.
    
    In the panel, Tracking switches the robot between an Idle animation and Look At, where it follows a target you can grab and move. Speed, Movements, Character and Vibe tune how it moves.
